cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or the code that produces it, please cite it as below."
title: "Andean Glacierized Catchment (Andean-GC) dataset"
abstract: >-
  A streamflow dataset for glacierized basins across the Andes (glacier area
  > 0.1%), integrating institutional records from Chile, Peru and Argentina
  with topographic, climatic, glacier and land cover basin attributes and
  historical ERA5 climate time series.
type: dataset
